# What `docker buildx build -f apps/worker/Dockerfile .` leaves out of its
# context (ADR-0175 Decision 3, ADR-0176). The media suites' stage needs
# `tests` and the workspace; the image itself copies only `assets/disclosure`
# and `apps/worker/image`. BuildKit reads this file, not a root
# .dockerignore. Patterns match from the context's root, so `**/` is what
# reaches every depth; no line may start with `!`.
**/.git
.github
**/.claude
docs
.pnpm-store
**/dist
**/out
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/coverage
**/.vitest
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/.e2e
**/.dev-storage
**/.dev-outbox
**/.dev-provider
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/next-env.d.ts
**/*.log
